<title>USA: SCI Systems sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>SCI Systems sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SCI Systems Inc said Tuesday that its board of directors had authorized a two-for-one common stock split in the form of a 100-percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>SCI said in a statement the dividend will be payable on August 22 to shareholders of record as of August 8.</p>
<p>Post-split shares outstanding will be 59.8 million and 72.8 million fully diluted, it added.</p>
<p>SCI Systems provides engineering, manufacturing, and support services to original equipment manufacturers in the computer, communications, medical, defense, and entertainment industries.</p>
